            {
                "entry_id": "e7dbb8b4-791c-3d28-a0c0-5b24284e6fcd",
                "word": "stubblefield",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "74de2c1d-ade5-453a-b1d5-3a8c77f11355",
                        "entry_id": "e7dbb8b4-791c-3d28-a0c0-5b24284e6fcd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "stubblefields"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f7ed074-702a-3f0a-afbe-2f8319292fe9",
                        "entry_id": "e7dbb8b4-791c-3d28-a0c0-5b24284e6fcd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative spelling of stubble field."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cac851f-5b41-4a3f-9735-ee8927e67263",
                                "sense_id": "8f7ed074-702a-3f0a-afbe-2f8319292fe9",
                                "text": "The peasantry had fled into the city with all their goods, even with their cattle; which however were driven out under an armed guard on the side away from the river into the stubblefields under the walls."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9125ecb2-9af9-46de-a692-0306e6337f14",
                                "sense_id": "8f7ed074-702a-3f0a-afbe-2f8319292fe9",
                                "text": "If, for instance, the seed is planted in a stubblefield and covered by running a cultipacker over it, much better results from the germination of small grass seeds may be expected than that from a very clean seedbed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfb0b812-f675-4883-8e42-054c70946af0",
                                "sense_id": "8f7ed074-702a-3f0a-afbe-2f8319292fe9",
                                "text": "“When I was about nine years old, a barnstormer landed in a stubblefield not far from our home in Beatrice, Neb.[…]”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "722be0fb-b8d1-4fe9-b50e-e88fbb6b6839",
                                "sense_id": "8f7ed074-702a-3f0a-afbe-2f8319292fe9",
                                "text": "The two birds then flew over a stubblefield."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "404b9a79-bea6-4a85-aa5b-adc52af309ff",
                                "sense_id": "8f7ed074-702a-3f0a-afbe-2f8319292fe9",
                                "text": "Heavy fighting resulted, and the Union troops made a steady, slow movement into a stubblefield, which the Confederates set ablaze to thwart the Federal progress."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "326809e0-7084-4d25-975d-45584ffb240f",
                                "sense_id": "8f7ed074-702a-3f0a-afbe-2f8319292fe9",
                                "text": "It was 40 years ago, down in the San Luis Valley, over by Monte Vista, your intrepid scribe went out into the grain stubblefields to take photos of cranes — greater sandhills and whooping."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
